  "post_content": "<p>El concurso escolar de tarjetas navide&ntilde;as, con su correspondiente exposici&oacute;n en el Centro de Empleo y Cultura, una charla de Ruth Aguilar y Ricardo Ten sobre deporte adaptado, un taller de risoterapida dentro del Mes del Voluntariado y la pesentaci&oacute;n del libro Juan Mezquita Almer o El sobrevujelo de la imaginaci&oacute;n, de la profesora ondense Concha Pi&ntilde;&oacute;n, han constituido el cocktail educativo-deportivo-solidario-cultural de la intensa tarde de este viernes en Onda.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresvesprada141212/1img_0002-1.jpg\" alt=\"1img_0002-1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresvesprada141212/1img_0002-10.jpg\" alt=\"1img_0002-10\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresvesprada141212/1img_0002-100.jpg\" alt=\"1img_0002-100\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresvesprada141212/1img_0002-101.jpg\" alt=\"1img_0002-101\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresvesprada141212/1img_0002-102.jpg\" alt=\"1img_0002-102\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresvesprada141212/1img_0002-103.jpg\" alt=\"1img_0002-103\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresvesprada141212/1img_0002-104.jpg\" alt=\"1img_0002-104\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresvesprada141212/1img_0002-105.jpg\" alt=\"1img_0002-105\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4